the los angeles rams may have taken home  the trophy for winning the 2022 super  bowl but marvel fans were big winners  too getting two new trailers for a pair  of highly anticipated marvel cinematic  universe projects one was a 30 second tv  spot for the upcoming disney plus show  moon night giving viewers a much closer  look at the oscar isaac led superhero  project but that was just the appetizer  marvel studios served up an entire meal  with a new full length of doctor strange  in the multiverse of madness trailer the  doctor strange sequel is directed by sam  raimi whose work on the original  spider-man trilogy is largely why those  three films are still well regarded  among superhero movie fans benedict  cumberbatch is set to return as the  titular doctor strange and he is joined  by elizabeth olsen as wanda maximoff a  character who hasn't been seen in the  mcu since the end of one division the  finale of that disney plus series not  only cemented wonder's mcu  transformation into the scarlet witch  but also shows her starting to truly  explore the limits of her magical powers  since the multiverse of madness trailer  was released marvel fans have dissected  it frame by frame for clues and easter  eggs and some believe they found one  that may shed further light and wander's  true intentions when viewers finally  catch up with her again it looks like  the scarlet witch may still be crafting  her own intricate believable illusions  in the one division finale wonder flees  for a remote location where she begins  to study a powerful arcane book known as  the darkhold in hopes of learning how to  control and further hone her previously  unpredictable powers now fans are  getting a much clearer understanding of  the person wonder has become by the time  multiverse of madness picks up there are  two brief moments in particular in the  film's second trailer that fans have  picked up on the first features wonder  and doctor strange chatting as they  stroll through a lush green orchard  strange having just dealt with the  events of spider-man no way home asks  what do you know about the multiverse a  little later it seems the two characters  are in the same location but the scenery  has changed not only does wanda seem to  have swapped out her regular clothes for  her scarlet witch costume but she has  also shown facing strange in what  appears to be an ominous overwhelmingly  red environment the trailer may want  viewers to believe these two shots come  from different scenes in the movie but  mcu fans seem to think they're one and  the same a sleuthing fan long jumping  trainer 38 pointed out on reddit the  framing of these two scenes is nearly  identical with wonder scene over  steven's shoulder and vice versa also  steven strange appears to be wearing the  same outfit and scarf during both his  normal pleasant conversation with wonder  and his slightly more antagonistic  interaction with her in that strange  crimson environment in one shot the  trees in wonders orchard are also shown  to be in bloom in another they're barren  if marvel fans are correct the most  likely explanation for these two  seemingly different environments is that  the lush green setting we initially see  wonder and strange walking through is an  elaborate illusion wonder has whipped up  to mask her surroundings in response to  long jumping trainer 38's observation  and theory about the two moments peter  parker 72 remarked very nice catch can't  wait to see how this plays out at this  point in the mcu's timeline creating an  illusion like the ones fans are  theorizing about would be child's play  for wonder after all she successfully  hexed an entire town in one division i  made mistakes  and people were hurt understandably the  possibilities presented by this theory  have also led fans to begin speculating  about the greater implications of  wanda's reality warping powers in  multiverse of madness redditor rich  archon visitor 70 for one wrote i have a  feeling she'll be the villain at first i  think it's a faint for a bigger bad in  the second act though redditer  bromogodman commented the mcu deserves  its fair share of fallen heroes and  raging psychopaths if wonder manages to  be both i'm all in now all fans have to  do is wait to find out all the  implications of wonder and strange's  mysterious conversation in multiverse of  madness which releases on may 6th 2022  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the marvel cinematic universe are coming  soon subscribe to our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one
 

